================================================================================
BUNDLED THIRD-PARTY FONT
================================================================================
This repository bundles the Outfit typeface, used for headings and other
display text.

  Outfit
  Copyright 2021 The Outfit Project Authors
  https://github.com/Outfitio/Outfit-Fonts
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1

  Files:   assets/fonts/outfit-latin-var.woff2
           assets/fonts/outfit-latin-ext-var.woff2
  Licence: assets/fonts/Outfit-OFL.txt

The OFL requires that the licence travel with the font files. Do not remove
assets/fonts/Outfit-OFL.txt. A CI check fails if the fonts are present and
the licence is not.

The font is self-hosted rather than loaded from Google Fonts, so that this
site makes no third-party requests. See docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md.
